cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "HelioHistory: A space weather living archive"
message: "If you use this dataset or software, please cite it as below."
type: dataset
authors:
  - family-names: "Allcock"
    given-names: "M."
  - name: "HelioHistory contributors"
license: CC-BY-4.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/Mallcock1/HelioHistory"
url: "https://github.com/Mallcock1/HelioHistory"
abstract: >-
  HelioHistory is an open, community-curated catalogue of major space weather
  events spanning from antiquity to the present, including geomagnetic indices,
  solar context, terrestrial impacts, and scientific references. Data are
  published as machine-readable JSON and CSV validated against a JSON Schema.
keywords:
  - space weather
  - heliophysics
  - geomagnetic storms
  - solar flares
  - open data
